Prompt:

Create a 9:16 premium editorial campaign where transparent optical material becomes the main structural element of the poster.

Brand/Product: {fill in}
Campaign: {fill in}
Portrait/Subject: {fill in}
Transparent structure: {vertical lens / wedge prism / curved membrane / folded optical screen}
Optical behavior: {refraction / caustic light / soft distortion / faceted displacement}
Color palette: {fill in}

Use a realistic portrait or fashion/product subject, one dominant transparent structure, strong typography, and meaningful brand information.

